"+- 83aa87e4 water: (1) river/pond normals now procedural (3 octaves value noise + analytic slope,","+  vnoiseDW in createWaterMaterial); the old normalMap (textures.rock) put straight crease lines","+  across the river. (2) GLSL_HELPERS rainRipples(p, t, fade) - NEW SIGNATURE (third arg; callers","+  pass rippleFade(viewDistance)), cells now 1/2.4 of the old, rings faster; skipped at fade 0;","+  terrain calls it only where tPuddle > 0.01. (3) pond scum line by distance to the edge (depth /","+  bed slope) and darker (was a wide pale band on shallow craters). (4) levelBuild adds every","+  crater's square to the terrain's `fine` list (+~100k terrain vertices in 30 chunks) so the pond","+  edge is not a coarse polygon. (5) groundmap: grass grows to 3-16 cm above pond water.","+  Frame times unchanged within noise (street 19.1, square 16.3, river 18.3 ms)."," "," Measured: the meadow grass costs ~5.8-9.5 ms on this headless GPU at high quality looking across"," the meadow (0.5 ms looking at the sky), and it scales with pixels (fragment-bound: shading the"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a11aa159-13a5-4cdc-8b6e-dfd306122a8e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedger