{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"e4b7cea272e82f17807a18ba3ecd408b5306783c905e8ebc85d7d907791476e4","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The pool holds 3000 alpha particles. A minute of sustained machine-gun fire into hedges could crowd out a grenade's smoke, so the leaf count will shrink as the pool fills and stop at 60% full."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Sc3iNUrdt7wtVxRuHRqFfE","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='js/effects.js'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    for (let k = 0, n = 16 + Math.floor(R() * 9); k < n; k++) {\n      const sp = 1 + R() * 2.6, col = LEAVES[Math.floor(R() * LEAVES.length)];\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    // fewer as the sprites fill up (a machine gun raking a hedge must not crowd out a blast's smoke)\n    const room = Math.max(0, 1 - alpha.P.n / (alpha.P.max * 0.6));\n    for (let k = 0, n = Math.round((16 + R() * 9) * room); k < n; k++) {\n      const sp = 1 + R() * 2.6, col = LEAVES[Math.floor(R() * LEAVES.length)];\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n \"$(grep -n 'a bullet through a hedge' js/effects.js | cut -d: -f1),+12p\" js/effects.js","description":"Thin the leaf burst when the particle pool is busy"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
