{"parentUuid":"50931753-c8fd-4f9a-a881-ea575c41dd65","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGAxn5tJUj7VKNRjS2is","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FGhBAKPALvaMHnz6rQ29JX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; enemy\n    tracers end where their rounds strike, and one glancing off stone or\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; a round\n    into a hedge or a bush shreds leaves out of it that flutter down on the\n    air, eddying and drifting downwind, with a twig or two and the rain\n    shaken off the leaves (fewer when the sprites are busy); enemy\n    tracers end where their rounds strike, and one glancing off stone or\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/ai.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: rounds through the hedges shred their leaves\n\nA bullet into a hedge or bush threw the generic dirt impact: green\nchunks that dropped like stones. In a mission fought across\nhedgerows, that is most misses. Now it shreds 16 to 24 leaf scraps\nout of the hedge, spread along its face and the round's direction.\nThey fall at about half a metre a second, eddying, turning over and\ndrifting downwind, for two to four seconds. A puff of green dust, a\ntwig or two, and in the rain a spray of water shaken off the leaves\ncome with them.\n\nThe enemy's misses now pass their direction to the impact, as the\nplayer's do. The burst thins out as the alpha sprites fill (none\nabove 60%). Twenty hits a second into a hedge for six seconds levels\noff near 1050 live sprites out of 3000.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git merge-tree --write-tree hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null && echo \"merge with hedgerow-poc: clean\"","description":"Commit the leaf burst and check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":681824,"output_tokens":865,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":450,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":865,"cache_read_input_tokens":681824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":450},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FGhBAKPALvaMHnz6rQ29JX":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 -I - <<'EOF'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold=\"\"\"    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; enemy\n    tracers end where their rounds strike, and one glancing off stone or\"\"\"\nnew=\"\"\"    water throws up a spout of spray and spreads a ring flat on it; a round\n    into a hedge or a bush shreds leaves out of it that flutter down on the\n    air, eddying and drifting downwind, with a twig or two and the rain\n    shaken off the leaves (fewer when the sprites are busy); enemy\n    tracers end where their rounds strike, and one glancing off stone or\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/ai.js && git comm