{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"790555cb8e7bcf7d6c6f276c8b893799f1369eef055ee467bec4a179c8e4d394","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013BQAopXcF9uBSkF3waZfcN","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","old_string":"  the night hemisphere: exposure, not a bug); the soft pale discs near the ground are mist sprites.\n","new_string":"  the night hemisphere: exposure, not a bug); the soft pale discs near the ground are mist sprites.\n- 9c7ccef6 muzzle flashes (effects.js muzzle()): star core 1.8x heat (was 2.4x) warmer, plus two\n  CELLS.flame tongues at random rotations, plus 1-3 powder sparks. Tried for the outer layer and\n  dropped: CELLS.puff (an orange orb), a second CELLS.flash (more spikes).\n  Observed, for the user: enemies in the night forest at ~18 m are nearly invisible (dark wool on\n  dark wood) - realistic, but a readability/gameplay call, not changed.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
