{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"ac134078-0261-4444-b9ef-611b820e0add","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:24:07.468Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"2d4441ab-c59c-40de-81ad-e31d46bcf36a","keep":1378,"tail":["42a9fad93146353fb9d2d437f0897abf2146b1e89e978b3cf78164b2f8451cca","9d76365837a5a97c7359fe8fd6d03b26bd395adf9f966d16e5f8cf64b91999f7","b518185c2c258010bd1e16117bd2563f36e7a545e99f09aafc81c2b6617714c0"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1380,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"e2c20df400547751f9d708342d12b75f2cfe76840967d3b4e7e788dd82d0c62d"}
{"parentUuid":"2bfdb315-0a9b-4031-9fef-757abf6896a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGF8i8EtdmnYubhGiVdP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This round added one commit to `hedgerow-grass`, not pushed: 293bb025, real-looking wood and steel on the gun in your hands. Shaders compile on all three presets, node checks pass, and the merge with `hedgerow-poc` is still clean.\n\n- **The problem:** up close the rifle looked like plastic. The whole Garand is one low-resolution texture seen from half a metre, the stock was flat brown, and the metal was an even, rather pale gloss. Guns were the one thing left out of the close-up detail that houses and soldiers already get.\n- **The fix:** within 2.5 m, all five guns now tell wood from steel by the texture's baked metal value and add detail in the gun's own space.\n  - **Wood:** fine grain lines and a figure of lighter and darker streaks run along the stock, glossier between the lines and slightly sunk into it.\n  - **Steel:** a dark, matte Parkerized grey that stays matte in the rain, mottled where the finish has worn, finely pitted, and worn bright along sharp edges.\n  - Each pattern fades out before it gets finer than the pixels. The FP rig itself is untouched; only material shading in `materials.js` changed.\n- **Result:** clear on the Thompson's stock and the Garand's receiver under the street lamps, subtler in firelight. One face of the receiver seen edge-on to a bright fire keeps its sheen, which is physically correct.\n\nTried and dropped:\n- **Smouldering craters with a lingering smoke cloud after blasts:** the existing explosion dust already veils the scene for 2–5 s, and thin crater smoke doesn't show at night even zoomed and brightened.\n- **The suspicion that distant enemy muzzle flashes vanish:** I measured it. They stay clearly visible out to 60 m.\n\nOne decision I left for you: blood. The game keeps it deliberately minimal, three short puffs of mist, no stains, and no mention in the README. Call of Duty and Medal of Honor spray blood onto the wall or ground behind a hit. That's a tone and rating call, so I haven't added it.\n\nAll test servers are stopped, no browser tabs are open, and my `launch.json` entry is removed. Notes are in the shared notes file."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":238,"cache_read_input_tokens":775706,"output_tokens":743,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":238,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":743,"cache_read_input_tokens":775706,"cache_creation_input_tokens":238,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":238},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0313a5de-2a7a-4400-9ecd-624de839be5b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGF8h7ydQjJ3yFXRQQkB","requestRef":"ac134078-0261-4444-b9ef-611b820e0add","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"e782f8f6-01cc-48bb-91a1-7c16019b812b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:24:15.324Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
